{
  "name": "基礎_Question_and_Answer_Chain",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 基礎 6：Question & Answer Chain（RAG 知識庫檢索問答）\n標準 RAG（檢索增強生成）架構：讓 AI 僅依據指定規章政策精準回答，徹底消除幻覺！\n\n📌 5 大核心節點連線關係（防呆指南）：\n1. QA Chain ➔ 必接 Model* (語言模型) 與 Retriever* (向量庫)\n2. In-Memory Vector Store ➔ 必接 Embedding* (向量化) 與 Document (資料載入)\n3. Default Data Loader ➔ 必接 Text Splitter* (文本切片器)\n4. 各插槽已完整對接，徹底消除孤立節點與紅燈警告！",
        "height": 270,
        "width": 470
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-380, -290],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b6-sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
